<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7648" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατρέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring up, cherish, educate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				523
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>,al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ φρόνημα</span>
			<i>raise</i> the spirit, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.2.34
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθρέψασθαι υἱόν</span>
			<i>have</i> him <i>educated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.2.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λειμὼν κάλλεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					74.58
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>grow up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατραφῆναι ἐν . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cam.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ Ἑλλάδι φωνῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					11.25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέτραφες</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.156
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνετράφης.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>feed up,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχναίνω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				33
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μονῳδίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					944
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατρέφεσθαι ἐκ νόσου</span>”
				<i>convalesce,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; of fish after milting, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				608a2
			</span></i>.</div>
